<title>UK: Deutsche unit sets 750 million Czech crown bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche unit sets 750 million Czech crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE FINANCE NETHERLANDS BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    750 MLN CZK   COUPON     10.50     MATURITY    18.APR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.15    PAY DATE  L-17.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 25	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC   1.20</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
